From: Maxim Stepanov <g.maxim.stepanoff@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 2 Jul 2026 10:58:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat(db): sidebar context menus for relations, databases, and
 connections
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Relation nodes: Open / Copy Name / Copy Qualified Name (quote_ident).
Connection and database nodes: New Query — an empty, focused, non-executing
query console bound to the node's database. Blank SQL is now a run no-op.

